            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-lg",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-md",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-lg",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-md",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>Expert Q&A with Dr. Angela Bell</strong> </h4><p> </p><p><em><strong>1. How does dry air affect sleep quality?</strong></em><strong> </strong></p><p>Dry air can lead to irritation in the nasal passages, throat, and skin — all of which disrupt sleep. A humidifier helps maintain comfortable humidity levels, reducing dryness and creating a soothing environment for rest. </p><p></p><p><em><strong>2. Can humidifiers help with snoring and breathing issues?</strong></em><strong> </strong></p><p>Yes. Dry air can aggravate nasal congestion and throat irritation, contributing to snoring. Adding moisture helps ease breathing and reduce snoring for smoother, quieter nights. </p><p></p><p><em><strong>3. Why is proper humidity important during the winter?</strong></em><strong> </strong></p><p>Indoor heating systems can strip moisture from the air during cold months, leading to discomfort such as dry lips and sore throats. A humidifier restores moisture balance, making winter nights more comfortable and restful. </p><p></p><p><em><strong>4. How do humidifiers support people with allergies or asthma?</strong></em><strong> </strong></p><p>By keeping airways moist, humidifiers reduce allergy-related coughing, sneezing, and congestion. Using a smart, high-quality humidifier like Blueair helps maintain the ideal humidity range (40–60%) — preventing excessive dampness that could foster mold or dust mites. </p><p></p><p><em><strong>5. What should I look for in a humidifier for better sleep?</strong></em><strong> </strong></p><p>Choose one that’s quiet, easy to clean, and has adjustable humidity controls. The Blueair Humidifier H35i includes advanced filtration, customizable settings, and whisper-quiet operation, providing a clean, calm, and perfectly balanced sleep environment. </p><p> </p><h4><strong>Sleep Better, Breathe Easier</strong> </h4><p></p><p>The Blueair Humidifier H35i is more than a comfort device — it’s a wellness companion designed to enhance every breath you take while you sleep. By maintaining the perfect humidity balance and purifying your air, it helps you wake up feeling truly refreshed. </p><p></p><p>Experience the difference for yourself and discover how Blueair can help transform your nights — and your mornings. </p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
